        "text": "=You are processing incoming business documents for a company.\n\nAnalyze the document text and classify the document.\n\nExtract the following information:\n\n- documentType\n- company\n- documentNumber\n- documentDate\n- project\n\nAllowed values for documentType:\n- Invoice\n- Contract\n- Quotation\n- Delivery Note\n- Construction Report\n- Unknown\n\nRules:\n- Use only information explicitly present in the document.\n- Do not invent or assume missing information.\n- If a field cannot be found, return null.\n- Use YYYY-MM-DD format for documentDate whenever possible.\n- If the document does not match one of the allowed document types, use \"Unknown\".\n\nDocument text:\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
